<h2>Your task</h2>
<p>Choose one real earthquake, tsunami or volcanic eruption. Explain what caused it, what it did, and what people did about it. Put your work on one poster, then defend it at a gallery walk in 4 minutes: about 2 minutes to explain, then 2 minutes of questions.</p>
<p>This replaces the written exam. It uses what you learned about sources in Unit 0, Earth systems in Unit 1, and plate tectonics in Unit 3.</p>
